<script lang="ts">
	import Demo from "./demo.svelte";
</script>

# Badge

Displays a small label, such as a status, a tag, or a count. Renders a `span`, or an `a` when `href` is set.

<Demo />

```svelte title="+page.svelte"
<script lang="ts">
	import { Badge } from "#lib/components/ui/badge/index.js";
</script>

<Badge>Badge</Badge>
```

## Installation

```pm
npx remote0 add https://plainsv.com/r/badge.json
```

## Variants

Set `variant` to `default`, `secondary`, `destructive`, `outline`, `ghost`, or `link`.

<Demo section="variants" />

```svelte title="+page.svelte"
<Badge>Default</Badge>
<Badge variant="secondary">Secondary</Badge>
<Badge variant="destructive">Destructive</Badge>
<Badge variant="outline">Outline</Badge>
<Badge variant="ghost">Ghost</Badge>
<Badge variant="link">Link</Badge>
```

## Icons

Place an icon before or after the label. Icons scale with the size.

<Demo section="icons" />

```svelte title="+page.svelte"
<script lang="ts">
	import { Badge } from "#lib/components/ui/badge/index.js";
	import { BadgeCheckIcon } from "@lucide/svelte";
</script>

<Badge variant="secondary"><BadgeCheckIcon />Verified</Badge>
```

## Count

Set `rounded="pill"` for a pill counter. Tabular digits keep the width steady as the number changes.

<Demo section="count" />

```svelte title="+page.svelte"
<Badge rounded="pill" style="font-variant-numeric: tabular-nums">8</Badge>
<Badge rounded="pill" variant="destructive" style="font-variant-numeric: tabular-nums">99</Badge>
```

## Link

Set `href` to render an `a`. Link badges darken or fill on hover and show a focus ring.

<Demo section="link" />

```svelte title="+page.svelte"
<script lang="ts">
	import { Badge } from "#lib/components/ui/badge/index.js";
	import { ArrowUpRightIcon } from "@lucide/svelte";
</script>

<Badge href="/docs/components">Components<ArrowUpRightIcon /></Badge>
```

## Sizes

Set `size` to `xs`, `sm`, `md`, or `lg`. The default is `md`, like the shadcn badge, and the corner radius follows the size.

<Demo section="sizes" />

```svelte title="+page.svelte"
<Badge size="xs">Size xs</Badge>
<Badge size="lg">Size lg</Badge>
```

## Rounded

Set `rounded` to `xs` through `4xl` or `pill` to override the radius from the size.

<Demo section="rounded" />

```svelte title="+page.svelte"
<Badge rounded="pill">Rounded pill</Badge>
```

## API

The `Badge` props extend the native `span` attributes, or the `a` attributes when `href` is set.

```ts title="index.ts"
interface BadgeBaseProps {
	/** Visual style of the badge */
	variant?: "default" | "secondary" | "destructive" | "outline" | "ghost" | "link";
	/** Padding, text, and icon size on the shared scale; defaults to `md` */
	size?: UiSize;
	/** Corner radius; follows `size` when omitted */
	rounded?: UiRounded;
}

type Props = BadgeBaseProps & ((CompPropsWithChild<"span"> & { href?: undefined }) | (CompPropsWithChild<"a"> & { href: string }));
```
